<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for drawinging.com covering analytics, local storage, and contact email."
  permalink="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <p>Last updated: June 1, 2026</p>
  <p>
    Drawinging is a static educational website. We do not require accounts and do not store drawings on our servers.
  </p>
  <h2>Information we may collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Email content you send to hello@drawinging.com</li>
    <li>Standard server or CDN logs from hosting providers</li>
    <li>Optional local browser storage for recent search terms on your device only</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>
    If analytics tools are added later, this policy will be updated to describe them. Search recent terms stay in your
    browser’s local storage and are not uploaded by Drawinging.
  </p>
  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>
    Hosting and deployment may be provided by services such as Vercel. Their processing of request logs follows their
    own policies.
  </p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:hello@drawinging.com">hello@drawinging.com</a></p>
</LegalLayout>
